/* LLVM Embedded variant of the board's Alif linker_gnu_mram.ld.src.
 * Preserve its table-driven startup contract; match linker_ac6.sct.src:
 * MRAM code, explicit ITCM code, DTCM runtime, and uninitialized SRAM0 pools.
 */

